Package: pollbias
Title: Relative House Effects in Historical US Polling
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Gaurav", "Sood", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A reproducible analysis project estimating relative polling house
    effects in Bush approval and 2008 presidential election polls.
License: CC BY 2.0
URL: https://github.com/soodoku/pollbias
BugReports: https://github.com/soodoku/pollbias/issues
